<ns0:section xmlns:ns0="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id9910358a-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc" identifier="/us/usc/t42/s2000c–7"><ns0:num value="2000c–7">§ 2000c–7.</ns0:num><ns0:heading> Liability of United States for costs</ns0:heading><ns0:content>
<ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">In any action or proceeding under this subchapter the United States shall be liable for costs the same as a private person.</ns0:p>
</ns0:content><ns0:sourceCredit id="id9910358b-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc">(<ns0:ref href="/us/pl/88/352/tIV/s408">Pub. L. 88–352, title IV, § 408</ns0:ref>, <ns0:date date="1964-07-02">July 2, 1964</ns0:date>, <ns0:ref href="/us/stat/78/249">78 Stat. 249</ns0:ref>.)</ns0:sourceCredit>
</ns0:section>
